concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36c-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36C(4) Declared terrorist organisation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-36c-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Parliamentary Joint Committee on Intelligence and Security may:  (a) review a declaration made under subsection (1) as soon as possible after the declaration is made; and  (b) report the Committee’s comments and recommendations to each House of the Parliament before the end of the period during which the House may disallow the declaration.  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(4) The Parliamentary Joint Committee on Intelligence and Security may:  (a) review a declaration made under subsection (1) as soon as possible after the declaration is made; and  (b) report the Committee’s comments and recommendations to each House of the Parliament before the end of the period during which the House may disallow the declaration.  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
