concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36h-ss-5 cml:asserts concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36h-ss-5-logic-descriptionlogic-2 .
