concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-21 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21 Section 51B report"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-21 ;
    values:originalText "A report prepared for the purposes of section 51B of the amended Act in relation to the reporting period in which commencement occurs must set out:  Amendments  Schedule 1 Application and transitional provisions  Part 2  No. 88, 2020 Australian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Cessation) Act 2020  (a) for the part of the reporting period that occurs before commencement—the matters required by subsection 51B(1) of the Act as in force immediately before commencement; and  (b) for the part of the reporting period that occurs after commencement—the matters required by subsection 51B(1) of the amended Act." ;
    skos:definition "A report prepared for the purposes of section 51B of the amended Act in relation to the reporting period in which commencement occurs must set out:  Amendments  Schedule 1 Application and transitional provisions  Part 2  No. 88, 2020 Australian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Cessation) Act 2020  (a) for the part of the reporting period that occurs before commencement—the matters required by subsection 51B(1) of the Act as in force immediately before commencement; and  (b) for the part of the reporting period that occurs after commencement—the matters required by subsection 51B(1) of the amended Act."@en ;
